<title>UK: BAT rise after Philip Morris gain in U.S..</title>
<headline>BAT rise after Philip Morris gain in U.S..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in tobacco to financial services group B.A.T Industries rose on Friday after a strong performance by Philip Morris in New York overnight, dealers said.</p>
<p>The group's shares advanced 4p to 424-1/2p by 0859 GMT in thin volume.</p>
<p>Philip Morris closed up $3 at $102-5/8 in New York on Thursday. --London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
